%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false}} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Technician<br/>(Senior or Tier 1)
    participant F as Foundry agent<br/>(Microsoft Entra Agent ID)
    participant E as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant G as API Management<br/>(MCP gateway)
    participant M as MCP server<br/>(managed identity id-mcp)
    participant K as Key Vault
    participant D as Dataverse<br/>(application user)
    Note over M,K: At startup
    M->>K: Managed identity token for vault.azure.net
    K-->>M: Gateway key (mcp-backend-key)
    T->>F: Request in the playground<br/>(user token for ai.azure.com)
    F->>E: OAuth connection servicedesk-mcp<br/>(user's delegated token)
    E-->>F: Token for api://gateway app<br/>with scope ServiceDesk.Access
    F->>G: tools/call with the user's token
    Note over G: Validate the token, set x-user-oid,<br/>x-correlation-id and x-backend-key,<br/>remove the token
    G->>M: tools/call with the gateway key<br/>and who the user is
    M->>D: Managed identity token for Dataverse<br/>with CallerObjectId = the user
    Note over D: Allowed only if the user's role<br/>and the application user's role allow it
    D-->>M: Result, or 403 from the platform
    M-->>G: Result with correlation_id
    G-->>F: Result
    F-->>T: Answer, after approval for writes
